<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>In this macro for Jujutsu Chronicles, you will have auto attack and auto recharge your energy, at the same time, the recharge energy are 3 seconds</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 14 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 14 ms
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 3 s
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 14 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>